47:00.030 --> 47:00.760
Boss!

680
47:00.790 --> 47:01.400
What?

681
47:02.190 --> 47:04.080
The folks from Rose Club are coming, Boss.

682
47:04.880 --> 47:05.810
What did you say?!

683
47:15.310 --> 47:16.820
Your guests have come all this way

684
47:17.810 --> 47:19.000
and you won't even invite us to drink?

685
47:21.640 --> 47:22.640
Why are you here?

686
47:24.000 --> 47:25.890
I heard you were looking for missing people.

687
47:27.320 --> 47:28.720
So I brought them here.

688
47:30.610 --> 47:32.020
Fuck, let go of me!

689
47:32.050 --> 47:32.910
Stay still!

690
47:33.030 --> 47:34.120
Sit down!

691
47:36.150 --> 47:36.920
Boss.

692
47:37.120 --> 47:38.120
Please help me, Boss.

693
47:38.400 --> 47:39.790
- Boss, Boss... - Let go of me!

694
47:40.520 --> 47:41.360
Ow!

695
47:44.520 --> 47:45.880
Why are you treating them like that?

696
47:47.320 --> 47:49.500
They came and caused damage to my pub.

697
47:50.010 --> 47:51.640
Just as you told them to.

698
47:51.930 --> 47:53.220
What the fuck are you talking about?!

699
47:53.300 --> 47:54.320
I wasn't in on it.

700
47:54.460 --> 47:55.600
Cut the bullshit, old man.

701
47:55.640 --> 47:56.790
What did you say?

702
48:01.210 --> 48:02.400
Make your choice.

703
48:03.620 --> 48:05.200
Your men will have to lower their guns.

704
48:06.020 --> 48:08.040
Or I'll shoot a few holes in your head.

705
48:13.180 --> 48:14.240
Didn't you hear what he said?

706
48:17.020 --> 48:17.720
Lower your guns!

707
48:30.130 --> 48:31.680
Let's try to be civil here.

708
48:33.000 --> 48:34.200
I understand

709
48:34.710 --> 48:35.960
that my pub opened after yours,

710
48:37.020 --> 48:38.080
yet it's more crowded.

711
48:38.820 --> 48:40.040
You might get a bit upset.

712
48:40.680 --> 48:41.560
But, sir,

713
48:42.960 --> 48:44.640
if you're going to be my competitor,

714
48:44.810 --> 48:45.800
try not to stoop so low, will you?

715
48:47.060 --> 48:49.320
Act more like the Dragon of this district,

716
48:50.320 --> 48:51.680
rather than a cowardly dog.

717
48:54.730 --> 48:55.960
This time

718
48:57.650 --> 48:58.920
I'll let it go.

719
49:02.420 --> 49:03.760
But if there's a next time,

720
49:07.710 --> 49:09.360
I'll make you pay back tenfold.

721
49:20.630 --> 49:21.560
As for your gun,

722
49:22.480 --> 49:23.440
I'll be taking it

723
49:24.190 --> 49:25.200
as compensation

724
49:25.890 --> 49:27.120
for restoring my pub.

725
49:36.210 --> 49:36.920
Boss, I'm sorry.

726
49:37.070 --> 49:37.960
Boss.

727
49:38.920 --> 49:40.000
Fucker!

728
50:24.370 --> 50:25.120
Mr. Kanthi...

729
50:29.940 --> 50:31.040
You're here?

730
50:32.610 --> 50:33.360
Come,

731
50:34.100 --> 50:35.320
sit next to me.

732
50:44.920 --> 50:46.720
You drank this much...?

733
50:47.320 --> 50:48.320
Sit down.

734
50:48.710 --> 50:49.960
Come drink with me.

735
51:00.510 --> 51:01.620
Drink with me.

736
51:04.100 --> 51:04.880
Um...

737
51:05.690 --> 51:07.160
I think you're too drunk already.

738
51:07.370 --> 51:08.120
It's none of your business!

739
51:09.910 --> 51:10.910
Mr. Kanthi,

740
51:11.340 --> 51:12.760
if you drink any more than this,

741
51:12.830 --> 51:14.360
you might die.

742
51:15.920 --> 51:17.280
Good, then.

743
51:17.870 --> 51:19.710
That way, I'll finally get to be with my mom.

744
51:24.940 --> 51:25.940
Mr. Kanthi!

745
51:28.900 --> 51:29.680
What's wrong with you?!

746
51:29.730 --> 51:31.020
I'm helping you!

747
51:31.940 --> 51:33.980
I don't know what happened,

748
51:34.310 --> 51:35.360
but do you really think

749
51:35.590 --> 51:37.400
your mother would be happy if you died?!

750
51:38.400 --> 51:39.980
That's none of your fucking business.

751
51:40.000 --> 51:41.320
Don't try to fucking lecture me!

752
51:42.070 --> 51:42.920
Get out!

753
51:44.870 --> 51:45.440
Go!

754
51:46.990 --> 51:47.720
Fine!

755
51:48.630 --> 51:49.880
I'll leave you be.

756
51:52.570 --> 51:53.320
Leave!

757
51:53.910 --> 51:55.200
Get out of my life!

758
51:56.110 --> 51:57.840
I don't need anyone!

759
51:58.170 --> 51:58.990
Go!

760
52:32.220 --> 52:33.360
Mr. Kanthi.

761
53:06.490 --> 53:09.960
♫Thank you for teaching me♫

762
53:09.980 --> 53:13.920
♫what love can be♫

763
53:13.940 --> 53:16.270
♫"Love" used to mean nothing,♫

764
53:16.290 --> 53:20.920
♫but now it's starting to have a meaning♫

765
53:21.620 --> 53:25.070
♫The love you gave me♫

766
53:25.090 --> 53:29.400
♫Is very fulfilling. You helped me realize♫

767
53:29.420 --> 53:36.990
♫that this love is meant for you and me♫

768
53:42.280 --> 53:43.240
Ah, you.

769
53:44.440 --> 53:45.360
Yes?

770
53:46.200 --> 53:47.320
Do you want to go to dinner with me?

771
53:47.420 --> 53:48.520
- Huh? - Wait, wait, wait.

772
53:48.720 --> 53:49.840
I'm not trying to flirt.

773
53:50.200 --> 53:52.000
I just want to have dinner with you.

774
53:52.280 --> 53:53.160
Where are you going?

775
53:53.400 --> 53:54.120
I'm going home.

776
53:54.280 --> 53:55.860
Well... before you go,

777
53:55.880 --> 53:58.920
why don't we learn one more sex lesson?

778
53:59.040 --> 54:01.560
But I've kissed to the point that my lips are raw.

779
54:01.660 --> 54:03.440
When will you teach me something else?

780
54:03.540 --> 54:05.640
The next lesson I'm going to teach you

781
54:06.360 --> 54:07.360
is oral sex.

782
54:09.200 --> 54:10.240
Yeah, like that.

783
54:26.240 --> 54:29.620
♫Thank you for teaching me♫

784
54:29.640 --> 54:33.720
♫What love can be♫

785
54:33.740 --> 54:35.980
♫"Love" used to mean nothing,♫

786
54:36.000 --> 54:41.320
♫But now it's starting to have a meaning♫

787
54:41.340 --> 54:44.840
♫The love you gave me♫

788
54:44.860 --> 54:49.240
♫Is very fulfilling, you helped me realize♫

789
54:49.260 --> 54:56.880
♫That this love is meant for you and me♫
